# Training runs and model weights stay local. Tracked data: the hand-written starter set,
# the synthetic training and development campaigns with their proofs, receipts and
# manifests, and the evaluation files (moved here from the Summarizer repository on
# 2026-11-13 at the user's request). Seeds are excerpts of real sessions, built pairs are
# derived from them, and held-out sets are read only by their author and the Reviewer: all
# three stay out of the repository, under the ignored top-level private/ folder.
/runs/
/data/*
!/data/starter/
!/data/synthetic/
!/data/eval/
models/
checkpoints/
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.bin
*.npy
*.npz
